WEBVTT

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.910
<i>Wumei! Osh! Synchronize your timing!</i>

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.290
<i>Roger!</i>

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.290
<i>Roger!</i>

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:19.740
Osh! Above you!

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:27.040
Now this is something.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.490
You don't often see Elan accept a duel.

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:33.970
I wonder if a certain someone's
bad habits are contagious.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:36.570
Three against one...
Just how conceited is he?

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:39.520
Show some pride, Daigo House!

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:41.060
Are you gambling on this again?

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.230
I bet 200,000 that Elan loses.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:50.820
Just try and shake them off!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:12.250
Osh! Wumei!

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.480
Damn it...

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:29.790
Looks like he won.

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:31.690
My 200,000...

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:34.960
How lame. Losing three against one...

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:38.450
You've got it wrong.
They played right into Elan's hands.

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:44.450
<i>It's burning, you know. Extinguish it!</i>

00:01:47.610 --> 00:01:50.510
Biological data for
Enhanced Person Number 4

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:52.390
is all within normal range.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:56.010
With these results, we can
move on to the next phase.

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:58.350
And what about the other witch?

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:00.900
Even in her previous duel with Jeturk,

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:04.930
we couldn't identify
a GUND Format data storm.

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:09.370
It's possible that machine has cleared
the greatest issue with Gundams...

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:13.650
the bioethical concerns involving pilots.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:18.310
I wonder whether it's the
mobile suit itself that cleared it, or...

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:22.130
It seems we'll have to
investigate directly, after all.

00:02:22.130 --> 00:02:25.830
Let's have Enhanced Person
Number Four act on our behalf.

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:31.330
He must be able to figure out
whether or not that thing is a Gundam.

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:35.000
Isn't this what we prepared him for?

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:12.480
Wow!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:16.640
I never knew you could
optimize frame action this way.

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:19.000
It's too complicated.
I can't make heads or tails of it.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.690
Nuno! What are the systems like?

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:24.910
The level of integration is
worthy of the gods themselves.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:28.120
How many first-class engineers
worked on this thing?

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:31.250
I can't believe they had that kind of budget.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:36.010
You really are thrillingly mysterious.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.470
This stone is your mother.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.110
It's really big.

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:49.400
Right...

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:51.710
I don't see any sign of your father.

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:54.350
My father... well...

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:59.720
I'm told that he died when I was very young.

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:01.900
I apologize if I hit a sore spot.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:02.910
Not at all!

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:05.740
Is this stone... a brother, maybe?

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:07.750
I don't have any.

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:08.990
Hmm...

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:11.430
What could it be, then?

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:14.220
Can you also read fortunes

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:16.380
for people who aren't here?

00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:17.790
Their birthday.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:20.460
Just tell me the person's birthday.

00:05:22.870 --> 00:05:25.230
I don't know it.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:31.520
Mr. Elan?!

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:35.070
H-H-H-Hello?

00:05:35.550 --> 00:05:39.480
Oh, yes. That sounds fine.

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.240
Right. Yes.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:42.330
What?

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:43.360
In that case, uh...

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:44.800
What's wrong?

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:46.280
H-He, uh...

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:50.130
He wants me to go out with him.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.080
On a date?

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.010
N-No! That's not it!

00:05:58.010 --> 00:06:01.890
He just asked if I'd like
to go somewhere on our next day off.

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:03.750
That's what a date is, dummy.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:05.520
Ms. Suletta!

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:07.940
Did you turn down that other proposal...

00:06:07.940 --> 00:06:11.070
because you're really after Mr. Elan?

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:13.000
N-N-No!

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:14.570
That's not it!

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:18.030
Both of them are really popular.

00:06:18.030 --> 00:06:21.270
But who'd have thought
the Ice Prince would make a move.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:22.440
Ice Prince?

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:23.280
Elan.

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:25.120
He never shows any emotion, does he?

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:28.630
Be it anger or a smile, nobody's
ever seen it on his face.

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:32.780
But a lot of girls are
into cool guys like that!

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.380
Sounds suffocating.

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:36.450
If I were you, I'd kick him to the curb.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:39.130
Well, Suletta's the one he asked.

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:40.720
He never smiles?

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:44.460
What's wrong? Calling at a time like this...

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:45.960
It's just...

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:48.530
I might go out on my next day off.

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:49.970
And, uh...

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:51.480
<i>I...</i>

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:54.880
Sound like you're making progress
on your wish list.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:56.780
You're going with a friend, right?

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:58.910
<i>Actually, it's...</i>

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:00.980
<i>someone I don't know all that well.</i>

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.620
<i>And yet you're going out together?</i>

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:05.980
It's weird, right?

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:08.000
Not at all.

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:11.160
You want to learn about
someone you hardly know?

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:14.210
<i>Is that what it is?</i>

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:16.450
You've made your mother happy.

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:20.890
<i>Isn't this what I taught you?
Move forward, gain two.</i>

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:22.050
Right.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:23.760
<i>Go have fun.</i>

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:26.460
Thanks, Mom.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.980
Was that your daughter?

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:31.620
She seems to be enjoying school.

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:33.220
Do you need something?

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:35.900
Peil Technologies is making its move.

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:40.160
It's sooner than we expected.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:08:00.250
True synergy of man and machine, is that it?

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.430
The balance trajectory graph

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:05.220
doesn't correspond
to any attitude control patterns.

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:09.510
And its reactivity is far too organic
for the drive system it's using.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:13.100
So you think it's body-augmentation control?

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:16.090
The ideal form of the GUND Format.

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:18.760
Normally, a task level this heavy

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:23.280
would instantly kill the pilot
with a massive Permet influx.

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:28.080
Which means that Suletta Mercury
must be an enhanced person.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:31.900
A human created
for the sole purpose of piloting a Gundam.

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:35.160
Just like me.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.960
This is no time for your grievances.

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:40.260
Is her face borrowed from another, too?

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:44.930
Wait... Are you happy about this?

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:49.560
You're the ones
who asked me to look into her.

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:54.100
If the physical examination is done,
I'm going back to class.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.270
Before you try battling the Aerial,

00:08:56.270 --> 00:08:58.140
I'd like to test the Pharact.

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:01.240
We'll need you to arrange another duel.

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.640
I'll just follow your orders.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:13.280
All right! Set it down just like that!

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:15.080
It's ready!

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:16.990
Ms... Chuchu!

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:19.750
You're really going dressed like that?

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:23.580
Mr. Elan said to bring Aerial too.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:26.010
A chaperoned date, huh?

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:30.310
Suletta! The container can go
whenever you're ready.

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:32.180
Thank you very much!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.310
On behalf of Aerial,

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:38.090
I can't thank you all enough
for the repairs...

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:41.480
Suletta!

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.470
What the heck are you thinking?

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:45.660
A date with Elan?

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.050
Oh, no!

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:47.060
Ms. Miorine!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:48.440
Hurry aboard, Ms. Suletta.

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:51.510
I told you the three branches
are our enemies, didn't I?!

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:51.520
Now, now...

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:54.120
Have fun on your date!

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:56.000
Make sure to ask about his birthday!

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:56.490
Let go!

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:58.250
I-I'm off!

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:58.240
This is between me and Suletta!

00:09:58.250 --> 00:09:59.460
Suletta!

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:01.860
Don't you dare go
all Romeo and Juliet on me!

00:10:06.150 --> 00:10:07.160
Hey,

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:09.010
what's Mr. Elan doing here?

00:10:09.010 --> 00:10:10.010
I wonder...

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:10.940
Go ask him.

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:12.090
No way!

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.600
G-Good morning!

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:26.720
I see you came on time.

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.100
Let's go, then.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:29.240
Right!

00:10:30.510 --> 00:10:31.650
Mr. Guel!

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.080
You won't believe this!

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:34.250
What is it?

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:38.120
The Mercurian girl is going
on a date with the Ice Prince!

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:40.670
With Elan? Don't make me laugh.

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:43.300
It's true! Somehow, they've...

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:44.630
Felsi.

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:48.870
Where did they go?

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:56.880
I'm sorry about this.

00:10:57.500 --> 00:11:01.150
My Zowort... is under repair
after the last duel.

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:02.550
Not at all!

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:05.740
If I... can be of help...

00:11:05.740 --> 00:11:07.590
I'm happy!

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:11.100
Inspecting the testing sector is also
the job of the Dueling Committee.

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:13.610
Can you go around in this order?

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:15.610
You got it!

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:24.910
Impressive piloting skills.

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:27.340
Not at all. I just...

00:11:27.340 --> 00:11:28.970
How long with this machine?

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:30.040
What?

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:33.000
I'd like to know more about you.

00:11:35.030 --> 00:11:36.770
I've always been with her.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:39.260
Since I was a child.

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:40.730
Always?

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:43.760
Did you ever struggle or suffer?

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:45.530
While piloting, I mean.

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:48.630
There wasn't any suffering...

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:50.520
I rather felt at ease.

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:55.960
We've always been together,
from childhood onwards.

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:59.570
To me, Aerial is like a good friend.

00:12:00.010 --> 00:12:02.450
Or even family.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:05.320
That sounds weird, right?

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:11.010
Uh... Mr. Elan!

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:14.640
P-P-Please tell me when your birthday is!

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:16.110
Can you do me a favor?

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:19.140
Huh? Sure...

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:22.220
I'd like to pilot Aerial by myself.

00:12:22.220 --> 00:12:23.180
What?

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:25.650
I won't be rough with one of your family.

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:27.480
So...

00:12:33.970 --> 00:12:35.810
Maybe he did this...

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:38.690
to avoid talking about his birthday.

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:44.570
I can expose the truth.

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:47.320
Whether or not you're a Gundam.

00:12:48.610 --> 00:12:50.120
Permet score...

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.470
Two.

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.300
I knew it.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:06.690
This is the GUND Format.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:08.390
No, wait...

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:10.530
It lacks that sensation.

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:13.860
Like a hand reaching
so roughly into my brain.

00:13:16.050 --> 00:13:18.490
The Permet isn't responding.

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:23.580
Which means, the one
who has lifted the curse is...

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:31.420
Suletta Mercury...

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:34.880
You're nothing like me!

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:42.640
Mr. Elan!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:48.550
I-I'm sorry!

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:53.110
You didn't want to tell me your birthday?

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:55.810
That's something...

00:13:56.340 --> 00:13:57.700
I've never had.

00:13:58.510 --> 00:13:59.560
Do you mean...

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:03.520
your mom never told you?

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:04.990
How you annoy me.

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:08.000
Your mobile suit is like family?

00:14:08.370 --> 00:14:10.660
These things are nothing but a curse to me.

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:13.630
I thought we were alike,

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.970
but you and I are...

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:25.850
Elan!

00:14:25.850 --> 00:14:27.130
You bastard, what did...

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:33.640
what did you do to her?

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:35.330
Depending on your answer...

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:36.770
You'll ask for a duel?

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:37.720
What?

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:40.480
Perfect timing, Guel Jeturk.

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:42.980
I challenge you...

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.790
<i>to a duel.</i>

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:49.530
Both parties,

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:52.240
deposit your souls on Libra's scales.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:55.990
The duelists are Guel Jeturk and Elan Ceres.

00:14:55.990 --> 00:14:59.160
The location will be
the 11th tactical testing sector.

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:01.120
The one-on-one code will apply.

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:02.210
Any objections?

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:03.420
None.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:05.170
No objections.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:09.550
It's been a while since we've seen
a duel among the three branches.

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:11.340
Guel Jeturk.

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:13.970
What is your stake in this duel?

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:17.440
That this jerk stays away
from Suletta Mercury.

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:18.310
I see.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:22.230
H-Hey, that's... none of your business!

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:23.980
Don't you get it?

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:26.860
This guy is your enemy.
He's from the three branches!

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:30.100
Doesn't that go for you too?

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:31.790
I...

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:32.820
Heck.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.380
Mercurian Miss.

00:15:34.380 --> 00:15:37.030
This duel is between Guel and Elan.

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:39.480
It's not your place to interfere.

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:41.290
Yeah, but...

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.480
If you're unhappy with the result,

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:45.920
then fight another duel yourself.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:49.090
Those are the rules that govern this school.

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:52.850
Elan Ceres, what is your stake in this duel?

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:54.260
I...

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:57.140
Suletta Mercury.

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:01.350
If I win, I will fight a duel with you.

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:04.560
Very well.

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:06.990
<i>Alea jacta est.</i>

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:08.650
The duel is approved.

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:12.740
Hey! Stop right there!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.620
Who the hell just boarded Lauda's Dilanza?

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:16.780
Actually, it's...

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:17.700
Brother!

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:19.080
You're forbidden to duel!

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:21.490
If Dad finds out about this...

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:26.250
If I win, Dad will have nothing
to complain about.

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:31.420
Why the heck are Elan and Guel dueling?

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.960
It's perfectly obvious!

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:35.730
Right, Ms. Suletta?

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:36.340
That's...

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:38.340
That's not it.

00:16:38.340 --> 00:16:39.600
This is a good development.

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.980
Let them destroy each other.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:44.390
You really are mean-spirited.

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:53.610
KP001, Guel Jeturk.

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:55.860
Dilanza... let's go!

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:58.370
This won't end well.

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.450
If the CEO finds out...

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.200
Please abort the duel!

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:05.170
My brother is not permitted to fight.

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.890
The duel is invalid!

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:10.800
We already gave Mr. Guel authorization.

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:13.050
Forgive me, Lauda.

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:16.090
I too want to see this duel.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.230
What?

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.730
A black Zowort?

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:30.020
I don't think so.

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:31.900
That one is...

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:36.110
KP002, Elan Ceres.

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:38.450
Pharact, going out.

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:45.890
Peil House has a new model, too?

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:47.000
Damn rich kids.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.420
Both parties, face off.

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:54.420
Victory is never decided by
mobile suit performance alone.

00:17:54.980 --> 00:17:57.680
Nor by the skill of the pilot, alone.

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:00.970
<i>The result itself is the only truth!</i>

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:00.970
<i>The result itself is the only truth!</i>

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:02.930
Fix release.

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:11.190
The new model flies too, huh?

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:12.320
Even so!

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:27.960
In low gravity, the Dilanza can do that too!

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:29.640
Whoa!

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:30.630
Look at them...

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:33.080
Go! Odds are 1.4-to-1!

00:18:33.080 --> 00:18:35.960
I can't believe you bet on that guy.

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:39.930
He's fighting too violently.

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:43.050
Look at all the clouds of sand
charged with static electricity!

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.680
Regolith...

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:51.270
Damn it.

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:54.480
<i>You'll be my assistant
in testing the Pharact.</i>

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.030
What?

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:01.910
A Gundam?

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:03.990
Permet score...

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:05.470
three.

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:16.300
What the...

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.800
D-Damage!

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:28.730
No, it's not that.

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:39.470
Functions are restored?

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:40.360
That looks like...

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.490
An electromagnetic stun beam.

00:19:43.130 --> 00:19:46.200
So this one uses drones too!

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.120
Those are no drones.

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:49.620
They're...

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:51.790
The GUND Format.

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:55.250
It's been so long...

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.920
Old friend.

00:19:57.940 --> 00:20:01.090
So there was another witch all along.

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:10.770
Damn it... in that case!

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:20.490
As long as they don't touch me,
this is nothing!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:22.030
You wish.

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:25.660
I'll make it through!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.250
I did it!

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:49.140
He fell into Elan's trap.

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:52.520
Elan used the conductivity
of the electromagnetic beams

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:54.770
to give the regolith an electrostatic charge.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:57.650
When the dust adhered
to the joint drive parts,

00:20:57.650 --> 00:20:59.770
it created an overload.

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:03.280
The key factor was actually caused

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.410
by Mr. Guel himself.

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.020
Stop...

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:39.190
The only way to defeat a Gundam...

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:42.150
I said stop!

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:43.610
...is with a Gundam.

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:51.280
I tripled my wager!

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:53.410
I can't believe this.

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:55.040
All right!

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:56.750
H-Hello?

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:58.540
Mr. Elan, you...

00:21:58.540 --> 00:22:01.540
I won. Suletta Mercury.

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:05.340
As promised, you will now fight me.

00:22:06.190 --> 00:22:07.840
Promised?

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:09.800
Suletta, did you...

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:12.220
The stakes of our duel will be...

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:14.810
the Aerial.

00:22:15.990 --> 00:22:17.730
<i>If I win,</i>

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:21.020
<i>your Gundam will be mine.</i>

00:23:53.460 --> 00:23:57.310
<i>Next time on </i>
Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch from Mercury,

00:23:57.640 --> 00:23:59.100
<i>"A Gloomy Song."</i>
